# Exclude from GitHub's auto-generated release archives (git archive).
# These stay in the repo and on GitHub Pages — they're just left out
# of the tarball that release tags produce, since the app doesn't need
# them at runtime (mappings.json is fetched over the network, and web/
# is only the changelog-submission website).
web/ export-ignore
data/ export-ignore
.github/ export-ignore
